                "text": "Getting a COVID vaccine should be just like getting a flu shot, but some insurers are delaying or denying payment\u2014leaving families unprotected during a surge in cases. I wrote to the country's largest health insurance CEOs to get us answers. https://t.co/ndNEoSWqEZ",
