                "text": "Americans who are illegally denied care or cheated by health insurers deserve justice. But too often, insurance giants force patients into arbitration to escape accountability in the judicial system. I just reintroduced my bill to protect patients\u2019 rights. https://t.co/jb3hdsLta6",
